title: hickSully
position: 127,-498
---
Hick: Mmm, have you asked Sully? He should have a spare copy of keys.
Hick: He should be here every couple of hours. 
Hick: And he usually stations there next to the ship after 17:00.
Hick: Unless he has work to catch up on at the hospital.
<<if set_flag("sullyKeys")>><<endif>>
