title: hickDocs
position: 137,590
---
Hick: Yeah I have them, why do you need it?
	-> He was my dad it's none of your business.
		Hick: Ok ok dude. No reason to get heated.
		The boy turns on his KomPat. 
		Hick: Here, I sent them directly to your KomPat.
	-> I want to extend the SDA. Maybe organize a funeral or something.
		Hick: Oh that's nice...
		The boy looks shook by your idea.
		-> Do you wanna come?
			Hick: I don't know man, my weekend's packed already. 
			The boy seems conflicted.
			Hick: I'll tell you what. You let me know once everything is set and I'll see if I can make it.
			Hick: But let me send you the thing first. Aaand sent.
			The boy turns on his KomPat and sends you the docs.
			Hick: I imagine you don't have Orbit anymore. I'll send them directly to your KomPat.
			<<if set_flag("hickRecruit")>><<endif>>
		-> Can you give me the docs now?
			Hick: Yeah, I can send them directly to your KomPat.
<<if set_flag("docs")>><<endif>>
